---

<Layout
  title="Nearshore Web & Software Development Agency | Codebrand"
  description="Full-service web development agency. Custom websites, apps, and e-commerce. Bilingual React & Next.js experts with 50 five-star reviews. Free consultation."
  image="/photos/bannercodebrand.webp"
>
  <!-- Reviews Schema for Google rich snippets -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline set:html={JSON.stringify(reviewsSchema)} />

  <!-- ============================================================= -->
  <!-- ACT 1 · HERO — instant, typographic, LCP is the headline text -->
  <!-- ============================================================= -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 font-poppins">
    <div class="hero-grid absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="absolute -top-40 right-0 w-[38rem] h-[38rem] bg-orange-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-28 sm:pt-32 lg:pt-40 pb-20 sm:pb-24 lg:pb-28">
      <!-- Headline: this is the LCP element — no animation -->
      <h1 class="max-w-4xl text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl xl:text-8xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white leading-[0.95]">
        Built in Honduras.<br />
        <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-400 via-orange-500 to-amber-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Shipped worldwide.</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        Senior engineers on your timezone — websites that sell, software that ships.
        Transparent rates from <span class="text-white font-semibold">$45/hr</span>, no agency overhead.
      </p>

      <!-- Dual CTA -->
      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3.5">
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 pl-6 pr-2.5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-500 to-orange-600 hover:from-orange-600 hover:to-orange-700 text-white text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold shadow-lg shadow-orange-500/25 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-orange-500/40 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:scale-[0.98] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-orange-400 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-slate-950"
        >
          Start your project
          <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white/15 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-0.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </span>
        </a>
        <a
          href="#work"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-slate-900/70 border border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-500 hover:-translate-y-0.5 text-slate-200 text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold transition-all duration-300 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-slate-500 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-slate-950"
        >
          See our work
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Speed-as-craft, classy one-liner -->
      <p class="mt-7 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-500">
        <Icon name="zap" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-orange-400" />
        Rendered instantly — no boot screen, no spinner. That is the whole point.
      </p>

      <!-- Proof row — bare editorial stats, animated numbers -->
      <div class="mt-14 sm:mt-16 grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-x-8 gap-y-10 border-t border-slate-800 pt-10 max-w-3xl">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white tabular-nums">
            <Icon name="star" class="w-6 h-6 text-orange-400" />
            <span data-counter="5.0" data-counter-decimals="1">0</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-slate-500">Google rating</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white tabular-nums"><span data-counter="50">0</span></div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-slate-500">Verified reviews</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white tabular-nums"><span data-counter="6" data-counter-suffix="+">0</span></div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-slate-500">Countries served</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================= -->
  <!-- ACT 2 · MARQUEE — tech we build with                          -->
  <!-- ============================================================= -->
  <TechMarquee />

  <!-- ============================================================= -->
  <!-- ACT 3 · SELECTED WORK — curated, named, verifiable            -->
  <!-- ============================================================= -->
  <section id="work" class="relative bg-white font-poppins py-24 sm:py-32 lg:py-40 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-14 sm:mb-20">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-slate-400">Selected work</p>
        <h2 data-anim="heading" class="mt-5 text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 leading-[1.05]">
          Web development projects with <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-500 to-amber-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent">real numbers.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-lg text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
          A curated few — custom websites, e-commerce platforms and lead-generation sites, each with results you can verify.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 sm:gap-6">
        {work.map((p) => (
          <a
            href={`/projects/${p.slug}`}
            data-anim="fade"
            data-anim-group="work"
            data-stagger="0.08"
            class="group relative flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white overflow-hidden hover:border-orange-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-slate-900/5 transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1"
          >
            <div class="relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden bg-slate-900">
              <img
                src={p.img}
                alt={`${p.name} — ${p.industry}`}
                loading="lazy"
                width="640"
                height="400"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-95 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:scale-[1.03] transition-all duration-700"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-col flex-1 p-6 sm:p-7">
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-slate-400">
                {p.n} · {p.industry}
              </p>
              <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">
                {p.name}
                <span class="block mt-0.5 text-sm font-normal text-slate-500">{p.kw}</span>
              </h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed flex-1">{p.desc}</p>
              <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-slate-500 tabular-nums leading-relaxed">{p.metrics.join("  ·  ")}</p>
              <span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">
                View case study
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
              </span>
            </div>
          </a>
        ))}

        <!-- 6th cell — honest "view all" tile, not a fabricated case -->
        <a
          href="/projects"
          data-anim="fade"
          data-anim-group="work"
          class="group relative flex flex-col items-start justify-center rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 text-white p-8 overflow-hidden hover:border-orange-400/60 transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1"
        >
          <div class="absolute -top-16 -right-16 w-48 h-48 bg-orange-500/15 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
          <span class="relative text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight tabular-nums"><span data-counter="16" data-counter-suffix="+">0</span></span>
          <p class="relative mt-3 text-lg font-semibold">documented projects</p>
          <p class="relative mt-1 text-sm text-slate-400">United States · Honduras · LATAM</p>
          <span class="relative mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-orange-400">
            See all work
            <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white/10 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </span>
          </span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-10 max-w-3xl text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
        Two more from the portfolio, both built in Astro: a site for{" "}
        <a href="/projects/studio-rndr-visualizacion-arquitectonica" class="font-semibold text-slate-900 underline decoration-orange-400 decoration-2 underline-offset-4 hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">Studio RNDR, an architectural visualization studio</a>{" "}
        carrying 45 renders in AVIF on 10.7 KB of HTML over the network, and{" "}
        <a href="/projects/ramonnuila-dev-portfolio" class="font-semibold text-slate-900 underline decoration-orange-400 decoration-2 underline-offset-4 hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">our own interactive developer portfolio</a>, measured at 100/100 for mobile performance.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================= -->
  <!-- SOCIAL PROOF — real Google reviews (schema above)             -->
  <!-- ============================================================= -->
  <section class="bg-slate-950 font-poppins py-24 sm:py-28 lg:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center mb-14 sm:mb-16">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-slate-500">Client reviews</p>
      <h2 data-anim="heading" class="mt-5 text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white leading-[1.05]">
